  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p data-end=\"526\" data-start=\"512\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַל תֹּאמַר:</span></p><ul data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"527\">\n<li data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"527\">\n<p data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"529\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"שָׁלוֹם עָלַי נַפְשִׁי\"</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"584\" data-start=\"556\">\n<p data-end=\"584\" data-start=\"558\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"בֵּיתִי הוּא מִבְצָרִי\"</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"585\">\n<p data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"587\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"הַשּׁוֹמֵר אָחִי אָנִי?\"</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p data-end=\"628\" data-start=\"616\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דַּע כִּי:</span></p><p>\n\n\n</p><ul data-end=\"721\" data-start=\"629\">\n<li data-end=\"661\" data-start=\"629\">\n<p data-end=\"661\" data-start=\"631\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּרִית עִם אֵ־ל כָּרַתְנוּ.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"662\"><p data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"664\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַחִים עֲרֵבִים נַחְנוּ.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"721\" data-start=\"697\">\n<p data-end=\"721\" data-start=\"699\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גּוֹרָל אֶחָד לָנוּ.</span></p></li></ul><p><br /></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p data-end=\"255\" data-start=\"153\">קַל יוֹתֵר לִבְנוֹת גָּדֵר מֵאֲשֶׁר גֶּשֶׁר<br />- וּבְכָל זֹאת, הַגֶּשֶׁר הוּא שֶׁמְּחַבֵּר אֲנָשִׁים.</p><p data-end=\"255\" data-start=\"153\">קַל יוֹתֵר לִנְעֹל דֶּלֶת מֵאֲשֶׁר לְפָתְחָהּ<br />-&nbsp;וּבְכָל זֹאת, דֶּלֶת פְּתוּחָה מֵבִיאָה חַיִּים לַבַּיִת.</p>\n</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כָּל הַפּוֹרֵשׂ מִן הַצִּבּוּר - אֵינוֹ רוֹאֶה בְּנֶחָמָתָן.<br />וְכָל הַמִּצְטַעֵר עִמָּהֶם - זוֹכֶה וְרוֹאֶה בְּנֶחָמָתָן.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div></span><div><span><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>\"כִּי קָרוֹב אֵלֶיךָ הַדָּבָר מְאֹד\" = 655 =&nbsp;</span>הקדוש ברוך הוא</span><span><br /><p><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><br /></span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\"></span></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><b>זִקְנֵיכֶם</b></span>' / '<span style=\"color: black;\">סָבֵיכוֹן</span>'<br /></span></span>❖ המבוגרים שבכם, אנשי הַשֵּׂיבָה - הסבים<span>.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'<span style=\"color: black;\"><b>זָהָב</b></span>' / '</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">דַהְבָּא</span>'<br /></span></span>❖<span>&nbsp;במילים ארמיות רבות - מוחלפת ז באות ד (זרוע-דרעא, זכרון-דוכרן, זה-דא).</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><b>וְהִבְדִּילוֹ</b></span>' / '</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">וְיַפְרְשִׁנֵּיהּ</span>'<br /></span></span>❖<span>&nbsp;להפריד, להרחיק, לבודד - להפריש.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">הַנִּסְתָּרֹת</span>' / '</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">דְּמִטַּמְרָן</span>'<br /></span></span>❖<span>&nbsp;חבוי, טמון - סוד טמיר</span>.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><b>רָע</b></span>' / '</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">בִּשְׁתָּא</span>'<br /></span></span>❖<span>&nbsp;גרוע, צרה - עסק ביש.</span></span></li></ol><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">👁️ מבט חד<br /></h2><div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjQOZGPFtInVrsGbdgUsr1BGQxFjKjzho_3xOEBDkZwrJIlb3AR6OO-8kFgvWPWKA7hCrp46RYeKX6L-O3aACnSF7Ag4VABjXubUWjUu-itRqLnX_SQDuuW_cRYTF6s7Evct24CQIhq-IeF1IfJnTFmayZ60cnH0XRKLFFrjxEXrmGnCaEoazCr84yFn9A/s458/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"מסך הודעת ווטסאפ על פלוני שעזב את הקבוצה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"458\" data-original-width=\"243\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjQOZGPFtInVrsGbdgUsr1BGQxFjKjzho_3xOEBDkZwrJIlb3AR6OO-8kFgvWPWKA7hCrp46RYeKX6L-O3aACnSF7Ag4VABjXubUWjUu-itRqLnX_SQDuuW_cRYTF6s7Evct24CQIhq-IeF1IfJnTFmayZ60cnH0XRKLFFrjxEXrmGnCaEoazCr84yFn9A/w170-h320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"170\" /></a></div></div></span></div></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div><span><div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; פרש מהציבור</span></div></div></span></div></div></blockquote>"
}
